## Overview
If I were to recreate this project I would add more testpoints on my PCB. This would make it easier to diagnose problems when getting the PCB to work. I would also and jumpers for power to be able to disconnect the ESP32 from the voltage regulator. This would help when creating the board to make sure the power works and the ESP32 work before connecting them together to avoid accidentally shorting components. I would also add diodes to the power and ground rails that connect to the other subsystems. This would be added to ensure teammates can not accidentally break my board.

